ead remains gently lowered with a calm expression and closed eyes. The camera trucks left with small amplitude at slow speed to follow her subtle aerial drift while maintaining the halo behind her head. The long teal and orange silk ribbons respond naturally to the movement, rising and unfurling in broad circular waves; embroidered fabric, loose hair strands, earrings, bracelets, and tassels sway softly with secondary motion. The halo gradually brightens, casting warmer golden light across the pipa and costume as glowing dust spirals outward through the smoke. During the final second, her movements decelerate, the instrument reaches its final angle, the ribbons settle into their new flowing arcs, and her limbs, costume folds, halo position, subject spacing, lighting, and complete composition converge precisely on Picture 2 at the 4.00-second mark.\n\noverall_soundscape: A gentle high-altitude wind moves through the dark space, accompanied by soft silk fluttering, faint jewelry chimes, and the delicate shimmer of drifting golden particles.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: N/A", 1344, 768, 73], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 259, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"name": "vae", "link": 260, "label": "vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "first_frame", "link": 288, "label": "first_frame", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "first_frame"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "last_frame", "link": 289, "label": "last_frame", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "last_frame"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "width"}, "name": "width", "link": 263, "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "width"}, {"widget": {"name": "height"}, "name": "height", "link": 264, "label": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "height"}, {"widget": {"name": "length"}, "name": "length", "link": 262, "label": "length", "type": "INT", "localized_